 \,000 from 197\,000 to 199\,000. The 4-week moving average was 198\,000\, 
 a decrease of 2\,500 from the previous week's revised average. The previou
 s week's average was revised up by 500 from 200\,000 to 200\,500.\nhttp://
 www.dol.gov/newsroom/releases/eta/eta20261008
