SUMMARY:[Federal Practice Areas] Unemployment Insurance Weekly Claims Repo
 rt
DESCRIPTION:In the week ending August 15\, the advance figure for seasonal
 ly adjusted initial claims was 206\,000\, a decrease of 6\,000 from the pr
 evious week's revised level. The previous week's level was revised up by 3
 \,000 from 209\,000 to 212\,000. The 4-week moving average was 204\,000\, 
 an increase of 4\,250 from the previous week's revised average. The previo
 us week's average was revised up by 750 from 199\,000 to 199\,750.\nhttp:/
 /www.dol.gov/newsroom/releases/eta/eta20260820
